/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/did/doc/TWFE.Rmd-460-    mutate(cohort_year = ifelse(cohort_year == 2004, Inf, cohort_year))
/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/did/doc/TWFE.Rmd-461-  
