/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/did/doc/TWFE.Rmd:664:As the result above shows, when you have a never-treated group, treatment effects are homogeneous across cohorts, and you do not bin event-times, TWFE event-study regressions do recover the true underlying dynamic treatment effects. 
