/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/did/doc/TWFE.html-700-<p>Instead of using variants of the TWFE specification above, we
/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/did/doc/TWFE.html-701-advocate you to use the procedure put forward by Callaway and Sant’Anna
/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/did/doc/TWFE.html-702-(2021) and implemented in our package <strong>did</strong>.</p>
/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/did/doc/TWFE.html:703:<p>In this specific DGP, as there is no “never-treated” units, we can
