/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/fixest/doc/fixest_walkthrough.Rmd-615-
/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/fixest/doc/fixest_walkthrough.Rmd:616:For staggered DiD analyzes, `fixest` provides the `sunab` function for implementing the unbiased method of [Sun and Abraham (2020)](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jeconom.2020.09.006) --- hereafter: SA20. The method is based on the estimation of `treated cohort x time to treatment` dummies which are later aggregated to obtain the average treatment for the treated (ATT) for each period (or for the full post treatment period).
