/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/did/doc/did-basics.Rmd-237-The argument `est_method` is also available to pass in a custom function for estimating DiD with 2 periods and 2 groups.  [See its documentation for more details](../reference/att_gt.html).  **Fair Warning:** this is very advanced use of the `did` package and should be done with caution.
