/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/did/doc/did-basics.Rmd-319-Finally, we can run all the same results including a covariate.  In this application the results turn out to be nearly identical, and here we provide just the code for estimating the group-time average treatment effects while including covariates.  The other steps are otherwise the same.
