/opt/homebrew/lib/R/4.5/site-library/did/doc/TWFE.Rmd:329:In this specific DGP, as there is no "never-treated" units, we can use the "not-yet-treated" units as a valid comparison group for each cohort. Furthermore, since covariates are not available (and do not play any major role into the analysis), we do not need to worry about the underlying "est_method".
